# ====================
# Docker 构建上下文排除文件
# 优化：减少构建上下文体积，加快构建速度
# ====================

# ===== Git 版本控制 =====
.git
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.gitmodules

# ===== 文档（不需要在镜像中）=====
*.md
LICENSE
docs/
changelog/
README*
!frontend/src/assets/*.md

# ===== 开发配置 =====
.claude/
.env
.env.*
.env.development
.env.production
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*.local

# ===== 临时文件和系统文件 =====
*.log
*.tmp
*.temp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.pid

# ===== 依赖（不复制，在容器内安装）=====
node_modules/
backend/__pycache__/
backend/*.pyc
backend/*.pyo
backend/.pytest_cache/
frontend/node_modules/

# ===== 测试和覆盖率 =====
tests/
coverage/
*.test.js
*.test.ts
*.spec.js
*.spec.ts
coverage/
.nyc_output/

# ===== 桌面打包（不需要）=====
src-tauri/
*.exe
*.msi
*.dmg
*.deb
*.rpm
*.AppImage

# ===== 构建产物（重新构建）=====
dist/
build/
*.egg-info/
__pypackages__/

# ===== 数据库文件（挂载卷）=====
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3

# ===== 设计资源（可选排除）=====
design-system/
*.sketch
*.fig
*.xd

# ===== 其他项目文件 =====
scripts/
merge-data.sh
merge-data.bat
start*.sh
start*.bat
update.sh
versions
pr.md
CLAUDE.md

# ===== 隐藏文件 ======
.*
!.dockerignore
!.gitignore
